FUNDING — THE CUT CHOSEN BLIND
59 symbols · 333 days · 2905 picks, 2521 with funding
halves: 1262 / 1259

Every threshold is computed on the DISCOVERY half only and read
once on the other. 'lift' is the kept trades against that half's
own baseline — a filter that costs volume must earn it.

